## Text Komponenten / textcomponents
## Code example for my Youtube tutorial videos
## Video: https://youtu.be/VZFGaXTvMEE


## Einfacher Text / Simple Text
tellraw Xenton_de "Einfacher Text"
title Xenton_de subtitle "Einfacher Text"
title Xenton_de title "Einfacher Text"

## Object: Text / Formatierter Text
tellraw Xenton_de {text:"Roter Text",color:"red"}
title Xenton_de subtitle {text:"Grüner Text",color:"green",bold:true}
title Xenton_de title {text:"Schwarzer Text",color:"black",shadow_color:[1,0.5,0,0.3]}

## Object Array
tellraw Xenton_de [{text:"Gelber",color:"yellow"}," - ",{text:"Text"}]
title Xenton_de subtitle [{text:"Schwarzer",color:"black"}, " ",{text:"Text",color:"red"}]
title Xenton_de title [{text:"Blauer Text",color:"blue"}," - ",{text:"Text",color:"black",shadow_color:[1,0.5,0,0.3]}]

## Object: Scoreboard
tellraw Xenton_de [{text:"Scoreboard: "},{score:{objective:"TestVariables",name:"_test"}}]

## Object: Data Storage
title Xenton_de subtitle [{text:"Storage: "},{storage:"tutorial:nutzen_rekursion",nbt:"data",color:"yellow"}]

## Object: Entity NBT
title Xenton_de title [{text:"Entity: "},{entity:"Xenton_de",nbt:"Pos[0]",color:"blue"}]

## Object: Player Head / Data
tellraw Xenton_de [{text:"Player: "},{player:{name:"Xenton_de"}}]

## Object: Item / Atlas, wie es nicht geht
title Xenton_de subtitle [{text:"Atlas: "},{"atlas": "minecraft:items","sprite": "minecraft:block/bamboo_trapdoor"}]

## Object: Item / Atlas - Block
title Xenton_de title [{text:"Entity: "},{atlas:"minecraft:blocks",sprite:"block/anvil"}]

## Object: Item / Atlas - Item
tellraw Xenton_de [{text:"Apfel: "},{"atlas": "minecraft:items","sprite": "item/apple"}]

## Object: Block Info / NBT
title Xenton_de subtitle [{text:"Block: "},{block:"~ ~ ~",nbt:"id"}]

## Object: Keybindings
title Xenton_de title [{text:"Taste Quick Actions: "},{keybind:"key.quickActions"}]

## Object: Translate
tellraw Xenton_de [{text:"Player: "},{translate:"advancements.adventure.blowback.title",fallback:"Back"}]


